    "detailed_description": "<strong>BlackSteel stealth horror game  taking place in a fantasy noir setting inspired <br>by Dresden Files. Dark alleys and depths of an abandoned car factory full of reanimated metal.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870570/extras/4a70f73c35d8a95e1b691ebd79ec1525.poster.avif?t=1726695599\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870570/extras/4a70f73c35d8a95e1b691ebd79ec1525.webm?t=1726695599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870570/extras/4a70f73c35d8a95e1b691ebd79ec1525.mp4?t=1726695599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Deep inside an abandoned car factory of Flamel Motors, something went amiss.<br>Inanimate world of cold steel was disturbed by unknown factors.<br><br>Sneak through factory halls, dark warehouses and ominous alleyways, uncover alchemical patterns and reagents that have various effects on surrounding world. <br>Thief-like stealth experience, hide in shadows, don't make a sound and observe what senses <br>your enemy is using. <br><br>Expand your knowledge of alchemy to unlock new areas and confront dangers. <br>An intricate story full of twists and revelations<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870570/extras/4869e0286b169986c4d523f4a96dd310.poster.avif?t=1726695599\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870570/extras/4869e0286b169986c4d523f4a96dd310.webm?t=1726695599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870570/extras/4869e0286b169986c4d523f4a96dd310.mp4?t=1726695599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Horror styled on noir movies with a pinch of Dresden Files like fantasy<br></li><li>Objects are alive, beware of EVERYTHING<br></li><li>Stealth gameplay \u2014 hide in shadows, watch what you walk on<br></li><li>Alchemy \u2014 find alchemy patterns and reagents, use them to unlock areas, solve puzzles and avoid danger</li></ul>",
